<?xml version="1.0" ?>
<AUTOSAR xmlns="http://autosar.org/schema/r4.0" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://autosar.org/schema/r4.0 AUTOSAR_00046.xsd">
  <ADMIN-DATA>
    <DOC-REVISIONS>
      <DOC-REVISION>
        <REVISION-LABEL>4.4.0</REVISION-LABEL>
        <ISSUED-BY>AUTOSAR</ISSUED-BY>
      </DOC-REVISION>
    </DOC-REVISIONS>
  </ADMIN-DATA>
  <AR-PACKAGES>
    <AR-PACKAGE UUID="ECUC:AUTOSAR">
      <SHORT-NAME>AUTOSAR</SHORT-NAME>
      <AR-PACKAGES>
        <AR-PACKAGE UUID="ECUC:ECUCDEFS">
          <SHORT-NAME>EcucDefs</SHORT-NAME>
          <ELEMENTS>
            <ECUC-MODULE-DEF UUID="ECUC:e9996ea9-86d2-4fb6-84a8-ef41aa695198">
              <SHORT-NAME>MemIf</SHORT-NAME>
              <DESC>
                <L-2 L="EN">Configuration of the MemIf (Memory Abstraction Interface) module.</L-2>
                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：MemIf是一个模块接口，它为上层模块（如NvM）提供了统一的接口来访问底层存储驱动，例如EEPROM和Flash驱动。</L-2>
                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置MemIf时，需要确保它正确地映射到底层存储驱动；MemIf配置应与底层驱动的能力和要求保持一致；MemIf的配置参数应遵循标准规定的属性和数据类型。</L-2>
              </DESC>
              <ADMIN-DATA>
                <DOC-REVISIONS>
                  <DOC-REVISION>
                    <REVISION-LABEL>4.4.0</REVISION-LABEL>
                    <ISSUED-BY>AUTOSAR</ISSUED-BY>
                  </DOC-REVISION>
                </DOC-REVISIONS>
              </ADMIN-DATA>
              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_MemIf_00025</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-SUPPORT>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-SUPPORT>
              <SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANTS>
                <SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>
              </SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANTS>
              <CONTAINERS>
                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:e338145a-6813-4489-af1f-25eedc3a3b95">
                  <SHORT-NAME>MemIfGeneral</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="EN">Configuration of the memory abstraction interface (Memif) module.</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：MemIfGeneral 是一个配置容器，包含了用于存储管理接口（Memory Interface）的全局配置参数，这些参数影响存储设备（如EEPROM或Flash）的管理和访问。</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：需要确保MemIfGeneral中的参数与所使用的存储设备的特性相匹配；此外，配置参数应当满足系统的性能和可靠性要求；在配置时，还应注意与其他BswM模块的兼容性和交互。</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_MemIf_00034</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <PARAMETERS>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:a26c464b-6da2-4a86-89e9-946ceb9024b0">
                      <SHORT-NAME>MemIfDevErrorDetect</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Switches the development error detection and notification on or off.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：MemIfDevErrorDetect是一个配置参数，用于启用或禁用内存映射接口（Memory Mapping Interface，MemIf）层的开发错误检测功能，以便在开发阶段发现潜在错误。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：当设置为启用（TRUE）时，系统将检查API调用的参数有效性等；在生产代码中，通常建议禁用此功能以优化性能；确保与底层存储驱动的错误处理机制兼容。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">* true: detection and notification is enabled.
                                        * false: detection and notification is disabled.</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_MemIf_00035</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:2ccf46a6-5f32-42c8-b33a-9be3d2b1f0a9">
                      <SHORT-NAME>MemIfVersionInfoApi</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Pre-processor switch to enable / disable the API to read out the modules version information.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：MemIfVersionInfoApi是一个配置选项，用于启用或禁用内存抽象接口（Memory Abstraction Interface）的版本信息API，允许软件组件获取当前内存接口模块的版本信息。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：启用此API可能会增加代码的ROM占用；如果系统对内存空间非常敏感，需要仔细考虑是否启用；此API主要用于开发和测试阶段，以便于诊断和兼容性检查。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">true:	Version info API enabled.
                                        false:	Version info API disabled.</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_MemIf_00032</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:ceddbf0c-99ad-44b1-9f1f-08c2a65ca876">
                      <SHORT-NAME>MemIfNumberOfDevices</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Concrete number of underlying memory abstraction modules.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：MemIfNumberOfDevices 配置项用于定义系统中可用的内存设备的数量，这有助于内存管理接口模块正确管理各个内存设备。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保此配置项的值正确反映了实际硬件中存在的内存设备数量；过多或过少的设备数量配置可能导致内存管理错误；此配置项应与实际硬件和系统需求严格对应。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">Calculation Formula:
                                        Count number of configured EA and FEE modules.</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_MemIf_00033</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <MAX>2</MAX>
                      <MIN>1</MIN>
                    </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:2ccf46a6-5f32-42c8-b33a-9be3d2b1f0a9">
                      <SHORT-NAME>MemIfUseEepromStore</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">MemIf Use Eeprom to store data.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：MemIf模块使用Eeprom的硬件和驱动去存储数据。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：需要保证实际软件中已具备Eeprom的驱动。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">true:	Use Eeprom to store.
                                        false:	not Use Eeprom to store.</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_MemIf_00032</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:2ccf46a6-5f32-42c8-b33a-9be3d2b1f0a9">
                      <SHORT-NAME>MemIfUseFlashStore</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">MemIf Use Flash to store data.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：MemIf模块使用Flash的硬件和驱动去存储数据。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：需要保证实际软件中已具备Flash的驱动。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">true:	Use Flash to store.
                                        false:	not Use Flash to store.</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_MemIf_00032</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                  </PARAMETERS>
                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
              </CONTAINERS>
            </ECUC-MODULE-DEF>
          </ELEMENTS>
        </AR-PACKAGE>
        <AR-PACKAGE>
          <SHORT-NAME>EcucDestinationUriDefSets</SHORT-NAME>
          <ELEMENTS>
            <ECUC-DESTINATION-URI-DEF-SET>
              <SHORT-NAME>RteRipsUriDefSet</SHORT-NAME>
              <DESTINATION-URI-DEFS>
                <ECUC-DESTINATION-URI-DEF>
                  <SHORT-NAME>RteRipsInvocationHandler</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESTINATION-URI-POLICY>
                    <CONTAINERS>
                      <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:34a06182-a4e4-4f79-b61d-3c3d2785a14a">
                        <SHORT-NAME>RteRipsInvocationHandlerFnc</SHORT-NAME>
                        <DESC>
                          <L-2 L="EN">This container describes an invocation handler function implemented by an RTE Implementation Plug-In to handle the invocation of server runnables and triggered runnables via a transformer.</L-2>
                          <L-2 L="EN">Tags: atp.Status=draft</L-2>
                          <L-2 L="ZH">概述：RteRipsInvocationHandlerFnc是一个配置项，用于指定RTE（Runtime Environment）中的RIPS（RTE Invocation Proxy Stubs）调用处理函数。</L-2>
                          <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置RteRipsInvocationHandlerFnc时，需要确保该函数与所需调用的服务兼容，该处理函数通常由RTE生成，因此在手动配置时应谨慎以避免与自动生成的代码冲突；最后，确保处理函数的实现满足系统的性能和实时性要求。</L-2>
                        </DESC>
                        <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Rte_79007</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                        <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                        <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                        <PARAMETERS>
                          <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF UUID="ECUC:de1cd0f2-18ae-49d1-bd49-2f907d1e6a22">
                            <SHORT-NAME>RteRipsInvocationHandlerFncSymbol</SHORT-NAME>
                            <DESC>
                              <L-2 L="EN">C-Symbol of the Rte_Rips_FillFlushRoutine function.</L-2>
                              <L-2 L="EN">Tags: atp.Status=draft</L-2>
                              <L-2 L="ZH">概述：RteRipsInvocationHandlerFncSymbol是用于定义RTE生成代码中，某个RTE调用点（RIPS）的处理函数的符号名称，这使得RTE层可以通过这个符号来调用底层的实现函数。</L-2>
                              <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该符号名称需要确保代码的可读性和一致性；符号名称应唯一，避免在项目中出现重名导致的调用错误；对于RteRipsInvocationHandlerFncSymbol的具体命名规则和使用方式应详细查阅相关文档，以确保符合标准要求。</L-2>
                            </DESC>
                            <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Rte_79008</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                            <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                            <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                            <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                            <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                            <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                            <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                            <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-VARIANTS>
                              <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-CONDITIONAL/>
                            </ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-VARIANTS>
                          </ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF>
                        </PARAMETERS>
                      </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                    </CONTAINERS>
                    <DESTINATION-URI-NESTING-CONTRACT>TARGET-CONTAINER</DESTINATION-URI-NESTING-CONTRACT>
                  </DESTINATION-URI-POLICY>
                </ECUC-DESTINATION-URI-DEF>
                <ECUC-DESTINATION-URI-DEF>
                  <SHORT-NAME>RteRipsPlugin</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESTINATION-URI-POLICY>
                    <CONTAINERS>
                      <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:b6b8f564-5772-4d48-8070-096066463e73">
                        <SHORT-NAME>RteRipsPluginProps</SHORT-NAME>
                        <DESC>
                          <L-2 L="EN">This container defines the identity of the Rte Implementation Plug-in and provides the RTE relevant parameters of the Rte Implementation Plug-in.</L-2>
                          <L-2 L="EN">Tags: atp.Status=draft</L-2>
                          <L-2 L="ZH">概述：RteRipsPluginProps 是一个配置项，用于定义RTE生成代码时所使用的插件属性，这些属性可能会影响代码生成的各个方面，如优化级别、代码风格等。</L-2>
                          <L-2 L="ZH">注意：选择的插件配置应当支持项目的特定需求，例如内存优化或执行效率；最后，更改插件属性可能需要重新生成整个RTE代码，因此在项目的早期阶段确定合适的插件配置是很重要的。</L-2>
                        </DESC>
                        <INTRODUCTION>
                          <P>
                            <L-1 L="EN">The shortName of the container defines the name of the Rte Implementation Plug-in used for the API infixes.</L-1>
                          </P>
                        </INTRODUCTION>
                        <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Rte_79000</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                        <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                        <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                        <PARAMETERS>
                          <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:cf86cf97-8cda-40c8-b23e-8d57afcc1b1a">
                            <SHORT-NAME>RtePluginSupportsIReadIWrite</SHORT-NAME>
                            <DESC>
                              <L-2 L="EN">Denotes if or if not the plug-in supports the Rte_Rips_IRead/IWrite macros for primitive data.</L-2>
                              <L-2 L="EN">Tags: atp.Status=draft</L-2>
                              <L-2 L="ZH">概述：RtePluginSupportsIReadIWrite配置项用于指定RTE生成代码时是否支持IRead和IWrite接口，这些接口用于简化组件间的数据读写操作。</L-2>
                              <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在使用此配置时，需要确保系统中的组件交互模式与IRead/IWrite接口的使用场景相匹配；此配置项可能会影响生成代码的性能和内存使用，因此在资源受限的系统中使用时应谨慎；</L-2>
                            </DESC>
                            <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Rte_79002</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                            <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                            <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                            <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                            <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                            <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                            <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                            <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                          </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                          <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:36dd9691-7575-449b-91c5-9cc966eb3f77">
                            <SHORT-NAME>RteRipsGlobalCopyInstantiationPolicy</SHORT-NAME>
                            <DESC>
                              <L-2 L="EN">Globally enables or disables the support for Rte Implementation Plug-Ins (RIPS)</L-2>
                              <L-2 L="EN">Tags: atp.Status=draft</L-2>
                              <L-2 L="ZH">概述：RteRipsGlobalCopyInstantiationPolicy配置项用于定义RTE在处理跨分区通信时，如何实例化全局内存拷贝的策略，以确保数据的一致性和隔离性。</L-2>
                              <L-2 L="ZH">注意：跨分区通信的内存拷贝策略需要特别注意数据一致性和隔离性的要求；该配置项的设置应遵循系统安全和性能的需求；不正确的配置可能导致数据不一致或性能下降。</L-2>
                            </DESC>
                            <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Rte_79001</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                            <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                            <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                            <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                            <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                            <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                            <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                            <DEFAULT-VALUE>RTE_RIPS_INSTANTIATION_BY_RTE</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                            <LITERALS>
                              <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:0c11e729-cd9e-84ea-4c6c-7821d4e46513">
                                <SHORT-NAME>RTE_RIPS_INSTANTIATION_BY_PLUGIN</SHORT-NAME>
                                <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                              <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:3bafee16-2876-8b5d-3c19-3bf2f1cfcb2c">
                                <SHORT-NAME>RTE_RIPS_INSTANTIATION_BY_RTE</SHORT-NAME>
                                <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                            </LITERALS>
                          </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                        </PARAMETERS>
                      </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                    </CONTAINERS>
                    <DESTINATION-URI-NESTING-CONTRACT>TARGET-CONTAINER</DESTINATION-URI-NESTING-CONTRACT>
                  </DESTINATION-URI-POLICY>
                </ECUC-DESTINATION-URI-DEF>
                <ECUC-DESTINATION-URI-DEF>
                  <SHORT-NAME>RteRipsPluginFillFlushRoutine</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESTINATION-URI-POLICY>
                    <CONTAINERS>
                      <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:82bac640-768a-4f73-b758-5aa570fb2f23">
                        <SHORT-NAME>RteRipsPluginFillFlushRoutineFnc</SHORT-NAME>
                        <DESC>
                          <L-2 L="EN">This container describes a Fill-Flush Routine function implemented by a RTE Implementation Plug-In to handle the buffering for implicit communication.</L-2>
                          <L-2 L="EN">Tags: atp.Status=draft</L-2>
                          <L-2 L="ZH">概述：RteRipsPluginFillFlushRoutineFnc是一个配置参数，用于指定RTE与底层硬件交互时，填充和刷新数据的插件函数，这些函数通常由RTE生成或用户提供，以实现特定的数据处理逻辑。</L-2>
                          <L-2 L="ZH">注意：需要注意函数的执行时间和资源消耗，以免影响系统的实时性能。</L-2>
                        </DESC>
                        <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Rte_79003</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                        <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                        <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                        <PARAMETERS>
                          <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:a603e53b-750c-44d9-9a4e-1dde1cfcf212">
                            <SHORT-NAME>RteRipsModeDisablingHandling</SHORT-NAME>
                            <DESC>
                              <L-2 L="EN">This parameter configures whether mode disabling dependencies are considered for the invocation of Rte_Rips_FillFlushRoutines.</L-2>
                              <L-2 L="EN">Tags: atp.Status=draft</L-2>
                              <L-2 L="ZH">概述：RteRipsModeDisablingHandling配置项用于定义RTE（Run-Time Environment）如何处理因为模式切换导致的Runnable实体的禁用情况，确保系统在模式切换时的行为符合预期。</L-2>
                              <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在设计模式管理逻辑时，需要考虑到各Runnable在不同模式下的可用性，以及如何处理这些Runnable在模式切换时的启用或禁用；此配置项对于确保系统在模式切换期间的稳定性和一致性至关重要；实现细节可能会根据具体的RTE供应商而有所不同。</L-2>
                            </DESC>
                            <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Rte_79004</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
